        </p>
        <div style="background:#F8FAFC; border:1px solid #E2E8F0; border-radius:12px; padding:1rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
            <div style="font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700; color:#6B7280; text-transform:uppercase;">Requirement Criteria</div>
            <div id="badgeDetailProgress" style="font-size:0.9375rem; font-weight:700; color:#7C3AED; margin-top:0.25rem;">
